  "translation": "On the weekend morning, I and my mother started from home and went together to a supermarket. We wanted to buy some fruit and drinks. The supermarket was very crowded. We first walked left to the fruit section. Mother asked me what fruit I liked to eat. I said I liked apples and bananas. Mother bought three apples. Then we walked right to get drinks. Mother knows how to choose drinks; she picked two cups of juice. We ran into our neighbor Aunt Zhang. She asked us how many things we had bought. I said we hadn't finished buying yet. She smiled and said, 'What a coincidence, I'm also here to buy things. Let's stroll together!' Finally, we had bought a lot of things and happily went home."
